@startuml
title تسلسل اكتشاف العملاء المحتملين - LeadScope AI
actor "مالك الحساب أو مسؤول أو مدير" as User
participant "SearchesPage" as UI
participant "searches/api.ts" as Client
participant "POST /api/v1/search-jobs" as SearchAPI
participant "SearchJobService" as SearchService
participant "BillingService" as Billing
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "AuditLogService" as Audit
participant "BackgroundTasks" as Background
participant "LeadDiscoveryOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "SerpApiService" as SerpAPI

User -> UI : إدخال معايير البحث
UI -> Client : createSearchJob(payload)
Client -> SearchAPI : POST /api/v1/search-jobs
SearchAPI -> SearchService : create_search_job(payload, workspace_id, user_id)
SearchService -> Billing : enforce_usage(searches_per_month)
Billing -> DB : قراءة الاشتراك وحدود الخطة
SearchService -> DB : حفظ SearchRequest و SearchJob(status=queued)
SearchService -> Audit : record(search_job.created)
SearchService -> Billing : record_usage(searches_per_month)
SearchAPI -> Background : add_task(run discovery)
SearchAPI --> UI : 202 SearchJobResponse
Background -> Orchestrator : run(job_public_id)
Orchestrator -> SerpAPI : جلب نتائج المزودين
SerpAPI --> Orchestrator : مرشحون وبيانات إثراء
Orchestrator -> DB : upsert leads وتحديث حالة الوظيفة
UI -> Client : getSearchJob(jobId) أو stream
Client -> SearchAPI : GET /api/v1/search-jobs/{job_id}/stream
SearchAPI --> UI : أحداث SSE للتقدم
@enduml
